{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1786629796610", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "我现在已经有足够的事实锚点。关键发现如下：\n\n1. **MiniMax-Speech (2505.07916)**: 已经拥有“learnable speaker encoder” —— 论文中已将其作为参考文献引用\n2. **Qwen3-TTS (2601.15621)**: 拥有 learnable speaker encoder + ECAPA-TDNN —— 论文中已将其引用\n3. **Cross-Lingual F5-TTS (2509.14579)**: 通过强制对齐（forced alignment）实现了 transcript-free\n4. **X-Voice (2605.05611)**: 通过合成提示对（synthetic prompt pairs）实现了 transcript-free\n5. **CV3-Eval**: 由 CosyVoice 3 作者发布 —— 并非完全独立\n6. **Voxtral TTS (2603.25551)**: 竞争对手 —— 多语言，3秒参考音频\n7. **IndexTTS2 (2506.21619)**: 最近发布的零样本（zero-shot）TTS\n8. **VoxCPM2, OmniVoice**: 可用的基线系统\n\n我再核实一下论文的具体创新声明与 MiniMax-Speech 的对比，并检查 GitHub 链接。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "0ff68ab2-a393-47ae-86ca-effed9b51010", "uuid": "573f6471-b10c-4358-a9ad-0d450fa6abcd"}
